`Brown high` @ground beef{1%lb|450%g}|@ground turkey{1%lb|450%g}[leaner] in a #dutch oven{}
over high heat with @-neutral oil{1%tbsp}, breaking it up, ~{6-8%minutes}. Season with
@kosher salt{1%tsp}.

`Soften` @yellow onion{1%large}(diced) and @bell pepper{1}(diced) in the same #&dutch oven{}
for ~{5%minutes}, then @garlic{3%cloves}(minced) for ~{1%minute}.

`Bloom` @chili powder{2%tbsp}, @ground cumin{2%tsp}, @smoked paprika{1%tsp} and
@?chipotle in adobo{1}(minced)[for smoke and heat] in the fat, stirring, ~{1%minute}.

`Simmer covered` with @crushed tomatoes{1%can|28%oz}, @kidney beans{1%can|15%oz}(drained),
@black beans{1%can|15%oz}(drained), @./Bases/Chicken Stock{1%cup}|@water{1%cup}[if no stock on hand]
and @&kosher salt{1/2%tsp}. Partly covered, ~simmer{30-40%minutes},
until ~{thick and the flavours settle}.

`Finish` with @lime juice{1%tbsp} and taste for @&kosher salt{}.

`Serve?` with @?sour cream{}, @?cheddar{}(grated), @?scallions{}(sliced) and
@?tortilla chips{}. See the [chili notes](https://example.org/chili-notes) for the
long-simmer version.
